2026-07-27T09:07:52.1749763Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:07:52.1750170Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:07:52.1750793Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:07:52.1751729Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:07:52.1752750Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
